  "instance_name": "weed_man_mapping",
  "label": "The man is mapped as 'the weed man'",
  "description": "The text 'when the weed man' at the top of the image explicitly labels the visual entity (the man) as 'the weed man'. This is an analogical mapping where the textual entity 'weed_man' is projected onto the visual entity 'man'. The term 'weed man' is a slang term for someone who deals or uses marijuana, and in this context, it is used to stereotype the man as a drug dealer, reinforcing a harmful racial trope. The mapping is established through direct textual labeling and contextual juxtaposition.",
